      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论如何都想成长，她这份心绝对没错。\r\n只是，她缺乏根据实际情况进行调整的灵活度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bf0a5fa64ff510a94161fe14df1df3e6bfe6631a30ec708b8ffa7c0832b2878",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
